            "review_title": "Review at La Vang Cafe",
            "review_text": "Lawrence M\nHigh Wycombe44 contributions\n0\nCheap fast beer\nJan 2020\nIt's not really a restaurant, it's not even a bar, it's just a place on the street which has outward -facing seating and sells drinks.\nYes there is a food menu, but it's plain to see that it's not their main business, so no surprises when they are attempting western style pub food and it comes up short.\n\nA good place for a few beers as you watch the world go by, nothing more.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 27, 2020",
