            "review_title": "Review at La Vang Cafe",
            "review_text": "Gill W\nLeeds, United Kingdom37 contributions\n0\nA favourite \"window on the world\"\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWe did not eat here so cannot comment on the food. However, for a cold beer, watching life on the walking street, it was our favourite stop in HCMC. The service is efficient provision of cold beers straight from the fridge and the staff, at all times of day, work hard and fast. No frills, great price. Love it.\nWritten December 8, 2018",
