            "review_title": "Review at La Vang Cafe",
            "review_text": "Kevin M\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam55 contributions\n0\nCheap and Cheerful Bar and Restaurant\nMay 2018 • Friends\nThis is my favourite bar/restaurant on Bui Vien Street. The prices are low (compared to some of the extortionate prices that other Bui Vien bars charge), the service is excellent, and there is a large and surprisingly good menu.\nYou can sit at street level and watch the world go by, or you can sit upstairs and look down on the street life.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 18, 2018",
