            "review_title": "Review at La Vang Cafe",
            "review_text": "TerjeHoegberg\nOslo, Norway447 contributions\n0\nMy favourite afternoon place in Saigon\nApr 2018 • Solo\nIt's my favourite afternoonplace in Saigon. The location suits me very well. Nothing is better than sitting downstairs with cold bia Saigon or Laroue beer and watching the busy and everchanging streetlife and let the time pass by. If you like you also sit upstairs on the terrace where there are more laidback feeling. I have been eating dinner at La Vang several times and the vietnamese food is tasty and good, especially the fresh springrolls and the caramelized fish in claypot.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 5, 2018",
